#: ../../reference/python-api.md:1
msgid "参考：Python API"
msgstr "Reference: Python API"

#: ../../reference/python-api.md:3
msgid "包顶层导出以下公开 API。签名以当前安装版本为准；本页描述的是 v0.1 的行为。"
msgstr "The package top level exports the following public API. Signatures follow the installed version; this page describes v0.1 behavior."

#: ../../reference/python-api.md:5
msgid "构建"
msgstr "Building"

#: ../../reference/python-api.md:21
msgid "`BuildReport` 字段：`output_dir`、`package_identity`、`point_count`、`channel_count`、`response_shape`、`response_rank`、`response_memory_bytes`、`physics_mode`。"
msgstr "`BuildReport` fields: `output_dir`, `package_identity`, `point_count`, `channel_count`, `response_shape`, `response_rank`, `response_memory_bytes`, `physics_mode`."

#: ../../reference/python-api.md:23
msgid "校验与检查"
msgstr "Validation and inspection"

#: ../../reference/python-api.md:32
msgid "`ValidationReport` 字段：`package_dir`、`package_identity`、`point_count`、`channel_count`、`response_shape`、`response_rank`、`physics_mode`。"
msgstr "`ValidationReport` fields: `package_dir`, `package_identity`, `point_count`, `channel_count`, `response_shape`, `response_rank`, `physics_mode`."

#: ../../reference/python-api.md:34
msgid "`inspect_environment` 返回的 dict 额外包含：`name`、`physics_mode`、`channel_ids`、`response_memory_bytes`、`observation_mode`、`include_pose`、`scenario_frames`、`episode_length`、`frames`、`units`。"
msgstr "The dict returned by `inspect_environment` additionally contains `name`, `physics_mode`, `channel_ids`, `response_memory_bytes`, `observation_mode`, `include_pose`, `scenario_frames`, `episode_length`, `frames`, and `units`."

#: ../../reference/python-api.md:36
msgid "加载环境"
msgstr "Loading the environment"

#: ../../reference/python-api.md:44
msgid "`make_env` 只消费校验过的环境包；接口语义见[概念：Gymnasium 接口](../concepts/gymnasium-interface)。"
msgstr "`make_env` consumes only validated environment packages; interface semantics: [Concept: Gymnasium interface](../concepts/gymnasium-interface)."

#: ../../reference/python-api.md:46
msgid "JSON Schema"
msgstr "JSON Schema"

#: ../../reference/python-api.md:54
msgid "支持的名称：`build-config`、`environment-package`、`geometry-channels`。未知名称立即抛 `ValueError`。"
msgstr "Supported names: `build-config`, `environment-package`, `geometry-channels`. Unknown names raise `ValueError` immediately."
